OL,3,GNEWSATwo veterans can make further MoD
OL,4,Aclaim over LGBT ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FVeterans who say they lost out on tens
OL,7,Fof thousands of pounds under an
OL,8,F"unfair" compensation scheme for those
OL,9,Faffected by the military's LGBT ban
OL,10,Fhave won the first stage of a legal
OL,11,Fbattle.
OL,13,FThe ban between 1967 and 2000 meant
OL,14,Fthose who were, or thought to be, gay
OL,15,For transgender were subjected to
OL,16,Finterrogation and dismissal.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
