OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSATwo veterans can make further MoD
OL,4,Aclaim over LGBT ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FSteven Stewart and Mark Shephard were
OL,7,F"forced to resign" and so were eligible
OL,8,Ffor the LGBT Financial Recognition
OL,9,FScheme. They received #7,000 and #5,000
OL,10,Frespectively but claims for larger sums
OL,11,Fwere refused as they were not formally
OL,12,Fdismissed or discharged.
OL,14,FOn Wednesday, Mrs Justice Eady ruled at
OL,15,Fthe High Court they could take their
OL,16,Fclaim against the MoD to a full
OL,17,Fhearing.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
